      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON MANDLA (4) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Calabrese (23.02) in a Maiden. Gave a start buy found the line well late. Can go on with it. BREAKING CURFEW (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (24.83) in a Maiden at Bendigo. Cannot be taken lightly. ORANGE CRUSH (7) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a long neck (22.44) behind Mcvee at this track. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Overdue and is among the main hopes. HADAR JAY (8) makes debut for the Jarrod Rocke kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Can sneak into the frame at his first appearance.",
